 Vulnerability Classification
| Vulnerability Type | Improper Time-Based Access Control / Time Validation Flaw |
| OWASP Category | A01: Broken Access Control |
| Attack Surface | Online Assessment / Examination Session |
| Affected Function | Assessment remaining-time validation |
| Severity : Medium
| Authentication Required : Yes |
| Required Access : Authorized assessment account |
| Potential Impact | Continuation of an assessment after its intended expiration |

The final severity should be determined by the affected application's security team after confirming the complete impact and exploitability.

